    vietnamese: "Ch\xFA Ba l\xE0m nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i b\u1EABy m\xE0u cam \u0111\u1EA5y.
      D\u1EE5 qu\xE1i gi\u1EABm v\xE0o \u0111\u1EC3 c\xF3 th\xEAm th\u1EDDi gian
      ch\u1EA1y \u0111i."
  - english: Watch your step, and look for more chests!
    vietnamese: "C\u1EA9n th\u1EADn nh\xE9, r\u1ED3i t\xECm th\xEAm c\xE1c r\u01B0\u01A1ng
      n\u1EEFa!"
